sequenceDiagram
    actor Alice
    participant TA as Typing (Alice)
    participant Srv as Server fan-out
    participant TB as Typing UI (Bob)

    Alice->>TA: keystroke
    TA->>Srv: typing start (then debounce, Ch 9)
    Srv->>TB: Alice typing
    TB->>TB: start client timeout (e.g. 5s)
    Note over TA,Srv: no more keystrokes
    TA->>Srv: typing stop (idle timeout / send)
    Srv->>TB: Alice stopped
    TB->>TB: clear
    Note over TB: if stop LOST, client timeout clears anyway - best-effort
